# A pattern is a shape, not a thesis. The engulfing bar says buyers
# absorbed the prior day's selling; three lower closes before it say
# there was selling worth absorbing. Context composes as a SEQUENCE,
# not an and: the engulfing bar closes up, so it would break a
# down-day streak measured on the same bar. Arm on the weakness,
# confirm on the pattern.

strategy "Engulfing After Weakness"

universe [sp_top_30]
timeframe 1d

when [down_days 3] then within 2 bars [bullish_engulfing]
  buy [risk 1%]

sell when [evening_star]
  or [doji 8%]
  or [stop 6%]
  or [after 15 bars]
